              "text": "la laverie — \"the launderette\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Les étudiants lavent leur linge à la laverie. The students wash their clothes at the launderette."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Une laverie automatique; in Québec, une buanderie."
